WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:06.120
You can suffocate evil

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:09.940
stave it

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:12.260
lock it behind bars

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:16.640
but it will find a way to come back even stronger

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.940
there is only one true way to end the evil

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:27.940
to finish it for good

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.320
let the devil out

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.500
 

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:47.480
I once believed that justice could be found in a court of law

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.480
 

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:51.460
Even in the light of day

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.200
but i was fooling myself

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.940
darkness only responds to darkness

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:04.600
and the truth is

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:07.380
I would rather die as the devil

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:11.640
than to live as matt murdock

